### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LEVEL 2 — COLLECTION-LEVEL READ (read-only dashboard / reporting)
### Scopes: read:laptops:*
###
### This token can read any document in the laptops collection and paginate
### through it. It cannot write, delete, or access other collections.
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Mint — collection-level read token
POST http://localhost:1538/auth/delegate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client_id": "read-only-dashboard",
  "scopes": ["read:laptops:*"],
  "ttl_secs": 3600
}

###

@col_read_token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ✅ Fetch any single document
GET http://localhost:1538/collections/laptops/docs/lp1
Authorization: Bearer {{col_read_token}}

###

### ✅ Paginate through the whole collection
GET http://localhost:1538/collections/laptops?limit=5&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{col_read_token}}

###

### ✅ POST /get with field projection across the whole collection
POST http://localhost:1538/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_read_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "fields": ["brand", "model", "price"]
}

###

### ❌ POST /get on a different collection → 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:1538/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_read_token}}

{
  "collection": "memory",
  "fields": ["capacity_gb", "type"]
}

###

### ❌ POST /set — write not granted → 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_read_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "data": {
    "lp99": { "brand": "Test", "model": "Blocked", "price": 1, "in_stock": false }
  }
}

###


### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LEVEL 3 — COLLECTION READ + WRITE (backend service, no delete)
### Scopes: read:laptops:*, write:laptops:*
###
### A typical backend microservice that manages the laptops collection.
### It can read and write freely but cannot delete documents or touch
### other collections.
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Mint — read + write token for laptops
POST http://localhost:1538/auth/delegate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client_id": "laptops-service",
  "scopes": ["read:laptops:*", "write:laptops:*"],
  "ttl_secs": 86400
}

###

@col_rw_token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ✅ Read a document
GET http://localhost:1538/collections/laptops/docs/lp1
Authorization: Bearer {{col_rw_token}}

###

### ✅ Write a new document
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_rw_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "data": {
    "lp_new": { "brand": "Dell", "model": "XPS 15", "price": 1899, "in_stock": true }
  }
}

###

### ✅ Update an existing document
POST http://localhost:1538/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_rw_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "key": "lp_new",
  "data": { "price": 1799 }
}

###

### ❌ Delete — not granted → 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:1538/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_rw_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "key": "lp_new"
}

###

### ❌ Write to a different collection — not granted → 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{col_rw_token}}

{
  "collection": "memory",
  "data": {
    "mem1": { "brand": "Corsair", "capacity_gb": 32 }
  }
}

###


### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LEVEL 4 — FULL CRUD ON ONE COLLECTION (read + write + delete, no admin)
### Scopes: read:laptops:*, write:laptops:*, delete:laptops:*
###
### Full control over the laptops collection. Cannot touch other collections
### and cannot trigger admin-only operations like snapshots.
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Mint — full CRUD token for laptops
POST http://localhost:1538/auth/delegate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client_id": "laptops-crud",
  "scopes": ["read:laptops:*", "write:laptops:*", "delete:laptops:*"],
  "ttl_secs": 3600
}

###

@col_crud_token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ✅ Read
GET http://localhost:1538/collections/laptops/docs/lp1
Authorization: Bearer {{col_crud_token}}

###

