### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LEVEL 6 — ADMIN (full access to everything)
### Scopes: *:*:*
###
### The root token itself carries the *:*:* scope. You can also delegate
### a *:*:*-scoped token to a trusted internal service. Admin tokens can
### read, write, delete across all collections and trigger snapshots.
### Only the root user can mint *:*:* (admin) tokens.
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Mint — *:*:* delegate token (root only)
POST http://localhost:1538/auth/delegate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "client_id": "internal-admin-service",
  "scopes": ["*:*:*"],
  "ttl_secs": 3600
}

###

@admin_token = eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJpbnRlcm5hbC1hZG1pbi1zZXJ2aWNlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc3NTU0ODc4LCJzY29wZXMiOlsiKjoqOioiXX0.dcYcCgI4AqYbyO4TKphATDZFLOhqrIgDcuJ7w3aRNFE

### ✅ Read any document
GET http://localhost:1538/collections/laptops/docs/lp1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### ✅ Write to any collection
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "data": {
    "lp_admin": { "brand": "Admin Brand", "model": "Admin Model", "price": 1, "in_stock": true }
  }
}

### ✅ Delete from any collection
POST http://localhost:1538/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "keys": "lp_admin"
}

### ✅ Read all
POST http://localhost:1538/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "fields": ["brand", "name"]
}


###

### ✅ Trigger a snapshot — admin only
POST http://localhost:1538/snapshot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### ✅ Delegate a new scoped token — admin only
POST http://localhost:1538/auth/delegate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "client_id": "new-client",
  "scopes": ["read:laptops:*"],
  "ttl_secs": 1800
}

